  "id": "pollution",
  "term": "pollution",
  "definition": "In this packet, pollution refers to plastic waste in and around freshwater environments that people recognize as harmful to inland fisheries and to the well-being and livelihoods of those who depend on these waters. In a cognition context, it is described through stakeholders’ awareness, understanding, concerns, and beliefs about its sources, impacts, and possible solutions.",
